A_056 - As for the "problem" of flatulence, it must be said that, since it is something completely involuntary and difficult to control, any judgment on the matter, conceptually speaking, is completely meaningless and baseless. In any case, for those who need it, there is a technique for farting silently: you have to misalign your legs, placing one further forward and the other further back (when sitting), and with a little care you can silently let the air out.